   cells compared 120 (12 rows × 10 cells); recomputed as printed 119; not 1
   the cell that differs: the exact p of the pre gap of r1, ts_demean, W = 60: 0.1871 in the run's table, 0.1873 from the file (3068 of 16384 sign assignments); the even count that prints the run's value is 3066; the file's rounding can move the difference between an assignment's absolute mean and the observed one by at most k/14 × 10⁻⁶ (k of the fourteen values enter it): 2 assignments and their mirrors are counted from the file with a margin within that bound (margin 0.00 × 10⁻⁶ against a bound of 0.64 × 10⁻⁶; margin 0.43 × 10⁻⁶ against a bound of 0.50 × 10⁻⁶), and 0 left uncounted lie within it, so that the unrounded values give between 3064 and 3068; the run's 3066 is 1 such pair fewer than the file's
